WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.735
-There's a lot to go over,
so let's jump in

00:00:02.735 --> 00:00:05.138
and cover it all at once.
It's time for a "News Smash."

00:00:05.138 --> 00:00:09.843
♪♪

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:11.310 line:0%
First up, the stock market.

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:14.747 line:0%
People on Reddit started buying
stock in GameStop as a joke,

00:00:14.747 --> 00:00:16.849
and it caused so much chaos
that some C.E.O.s

00:00:16.849 --> 00:00:18.618
want trading to be halted.

00:00:18.618 --> 00:00:20.552
People can't keep their eyes off
the market right now.

00:00:20.552 --> 00:00:23.155
You know what else people
can't keep their eyes off of?

00:00:23.155 --> 00:00:24.557
"Bridgerton."

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:26.959
It's officially the most-watched
series in Netflix history,

00:00:26.959 --> 00:00:28.928
with 82 million viewers.

00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:32.565
The characters are high-society
Londoners, so fancy and proper.

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:35.435
They're kind of like people
who wouldn't be caught dead at

00:00:35.435 --> 00:00:38.571
the new Margaritaville Resort
in Times Square.

00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:39.672
It's coming later this year.

00:00:39.672 --> 00:00:42.008
It has an outdoor pool,
rooftop views,

00:00:42.008 --> 00:00:45.111
and a giant Statue of Liberty
holding a margarita.

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:48.948
If you ask me,
the whole thing seems...nuts.

00:00:48.948 --> 00:00:50.850
Yeah, there's
a Grape-Nuts shortage.

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:52.718
The company says
it's difficult to produce

00:00:52.718 --> 00:00:56.422
the cereal right now, and
most stores are out of stock.

00:00:56.422 --> 00:00:59.325
What's happening?
Are stocks going up, down?

00:00:59.325 --> 00:01:01.827
It feels like Reddit
took a hammer to the market,

00:01:01.827 --> 00:01:03.696
and now the
system's totally smashed.

00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:05.898
And if you want to get
totally smashed, why not try...

00:01:05.898 --> 00:01:08.334
the Margaritaville Resort
in Times Square.

00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:10.670
You probably shouldn't swim
with a bunch of drunk strangers,

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:12.038
but do your thing.

00:01:12.038 --> 00:01:14.807
I'll be on my couch,
sipping tea and watching...

00:01:14.807 --> 00:01:16.509
"Bridgerton."

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:18.478
It's a great show.
There's romance, scandal,

00:01:18.478 --> 00:01:20.312
and, in that
classic British fashion,

00:01:20.312 --> 00:01:21.815
the humor is really dry.

00:01:21.815 --> 00:01:23.816
But not nearly as dry as...

00:01:23.816 --> 00:01:29.855
Grape-Nuts, everyone's
favorite gravel-based cereal.

00:01:29.855 --> 00:01:31.023
The company is suffering,

00:01:31.023 --> 00:01:32.558
and that's why we should all...

00:01:32.558 --> 00:01:33.692
buy now!

00:01:33.692 --> 00:01:35.628
Get it while it's low.

00:01:35.628 --> 00:01:39.532
There can be as rich as everyone
on "Bridgerton."

00:01:39.532 --> 00:01:41.167
In conclusion...

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:42.534
it's taking a hit...

00:01:42.534 --> 00:01:44.370
it's full of Brits...

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:46.405
it's a spoonful of grit...

00:01:46.405 --> 00:01:48.274
Elmo's about to get lit.

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:50.710
This has been a "News Smash."

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:55.214
♪♪

00:01:55.214 --> 00:01:57.250 line:0%
First up,
it's St. Patrick's Day.

00:01:57.250 --> 00:01:59.485 line:0%
The big parade might not be
happening this year.

00:01:59.485 --> 00:02:01.654
But that doesn't mean
you can't celebrate the Irish

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:03.355
with some corned beef
and cabbage

00:02:03.355 --> 00:02:05.291
that you bought
using the money from...

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:06.726
your stimulus check.

00:02:06.726 --> 00:02:09.429
Biden says 100 million people
will receive $1,400

00:02:09.429 --> 00:02:11.297
or more in the next 10 days.

00:02:11.297 --> 00:02:14.200
Though I have a feeling a lot of
them will blow their money on...

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:15.334
March Madness.

00:02:15.334 --> 00:02:17.136
People are making bets
left and right.

00:02:17.136 --> 00:02:19.572
Who will make it to
the Sweet 16, the Final Four?

00:02:19.572 --> 00:02:20.906
Who will go all the way?

00:02:20.906 --> 00:02:23.409
Well, if you want to go all
the way, why not try...

00:02:23.409 --> 00:02:24.677
Tinder?

00:02:24.677 --> 00:02:26.512
The app is in the news
because they're mailing

00:02:26.512 --> 00:02:28.814
free COVID tests to people,
so they can be safe

00:02:28.814 --> 00:02:30.250
before going on dates.

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:32.418
Some users like the idea,
others think it's weird,

00:02:32.418 --> 00:02:34.887
but one idea
everyone can get behind?

00:02:34.887 --> 00:02:36.456
Stimulus checks.

00:02:36.456 --> 00:02:38.190
Gimme that stimmy.

00:02:38.190 --> 00:02:39.959
That moolah.
That cold, hard cash.

00:02:39.959 --> 00:02:41.961
That cheddar. That paper.
That lettuce.

00:02:41.961 --> 00:02:43.696
That...green.

00:02:43.696 --> 00:02:45.765
Green beer. Green hair.
Green clothes.

00:02:45.765 --> 00:02:47.666
Some people pinch you
if you're not wearing green.

00:02:47.666 --> 00:02:49.569
And they're the kind of people
you should avoid on...

00:02:49.569 --> 00:02:51.037
Tinder.

00:02:51.037 --> 00:02:53.506
You can get tested before a big
date, and let's be honest,

00:02:53.506 --> 00:02:56.442
you should probably get
"tested" after, too.

00:02:56.442 --> 00:02:59.412
Though I've got to say, dating
right now seems like complete...

00:02:59.412 --> 00:03:02.382
madness -- 68 teams
vying for the top spot.

00:03:02.382 --> 00:03:04.117
A bunch of college kids
going at it,

00:03:04.117 --> 00:03:06.052
which is also a great way
to describe...

00:03:06.052 --> 00:03:08.021
Tinder.

00:03:08.021 --> 00:03:09.455
In conclusion...

00:03:09.455 --> 00:03:10.923
you're in luck.

00:03:10.923 --> 00:03:12.424
Good luck out there.

00:03:12.424 --> 00:03:13.993
You might get lucky.

00:03:13.993 --> 00:03:15.628
[Irish accent]
It's the luck o' the Irish.

00:03:15.628 --> 00:03:17.463
This has been a "News Smash."

00:03:17.463 --> 00:03:22.367
♪♪

00:03:22.367 --> 00:03:24.237 line:0%
First up, the Masters.

00:03:24.237 --> 00:03:25.638 line:0%
The tournament
kicked off this week,

00:03:25.638 --> 00:03:27.506
and professional golfers
from all over the world

00:03:27.506 --> 00:03:28.675
are in Georgia.

00:03:28.675 --> 00:03:30.510
I just hope they all got...

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:32.278
the vaccine.

00:03:32.278 --> 00:03:34.547
One in four Americans
has already gotten theirs,

00:03:34.547 --> 00:03:36.716
and that's more than
60 million people.

00:03:36.716 --> 00:03:38.384
Yeah. 60 million.

00:03:38.384 --> 00:03:40.085
Which is also
the number of new...

00:03:40.085 --> 00:03:42.722
Taylor Swift albums.

00:03:42.722 --> 00:03:45.558
This is her third album
in less than a year.

00:03:45.558 --> 00:03:48.627
Some of her songs are hopeful,
some are heartbreaking.

00:03:48.627 --> 00:03:49.962
If you'd like
your heart to break,

00:03:49.962 --> 00:03:51.130
why not try...

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:54.166
Jimmy Dean's new
Breakfast Nuggets.

00:03:54.166 --> 00:03:56.101
I mean, if you want to wake up
first thing in the morning

00:03:56.101 --> 00:03:58.170
and burn your mouth
on some microwave nuggets,

00:03:58.170 --> 00:03:59.639
you must be pretty...

00:03:59.639 --> 00:04:01.273
fearless.

00:04:01.273 --> 00:04:02.275
Yep.

00:04:02.275 --> 00:04:03.843
Taylor re-recorded
her hit album.

00:04:03.843 --> 00:04:06.312
Long story short,
she's reclaiming her old songs

00:04:06.312 --> 00:04:07.746
because she lost
the rights to the...

00:04:07.746 --> 00:04:10.282
Masters.

00:04:10.282 --> 00:04:13.486
There's Brooks Koepka,
Rory McIlroy, Jordan Spieth.

00:04:13.486 --> 00:04:16.421
They might have weird names,
but they get the job done.

00:04:16.421 --> 00:04:17.456
Kind of like...

00:04:17.456 --> 00:04:19.225
the vaccines.

00:04:19.225 --> 00:04:21.927
Some people have reported
feeling sore and woozy

00:04:21.927 --> 00:04:23.162
after their second dose,

00:04:23.162 --> 00:04:25.230
which is also how you'll feel
after eating...

00:04:25.230 --> 00:04:28.835
Jimmy Dean's new
Breakfast Nuggets.

00:04:28.835 --> 00:04:30.236
In conclusion...

00:04:30.236 --> 00:04:31.704
you're number one...

00:04:31.704 --> 00:04:33.538
two flavors...

00:04:33.538 --> 00:04:35.708
three great options...

00:04:35.708 --> 00:04:37.576
"Fore!"

00:04:37.576 --> 00:04:39.612
This has been a "News Smash."

00:04:39.612 --> 00:04:44.250
♪♪

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:46.285 line:0%
First up, Prince William
and Kate Middleton

00:04:46.285 --> 00:04:48.187 line:0%
have launched
their own YouTube channel.

00:04:48.187 --> 00:04:51.524
They plan to upload videos,
though it's not clear how often.

00:04:51.524 --> 00:04:54.393
They could post every day
or they could post...

00:04:54.393 --> 00:04:55.962
once every 17 years.

00:04:55.962 --> 00:04:58.163
That's right.
The cicadas are back.

00:04:58.163 --> 00:05:01.701
Experts are expecting trillions
of these loud, obnoxious bugs

00:05:01.701 --> 00:05:04.904
to emerge from underground,
just in time for...

00:05:04.904 --> 00:05:06.605
Mother's Day.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:06.605 --> 00:05:08.441
It's this weekend, so if
you haven't bought a gift,

00:05:08.441 --> 00:05:09.775
you should get on that.

00:05:09.775 --> 00:05:11.543
Though, Mom would be happy
with whatever you get her

00:05:11.543 --> 00:05:12.945
as long as it isn't...

00:05:12.945 --> 00:05:16.014
a taco with a cigarette inside.

00:05:16.014 --> 00:05:18.116
That's right, a woman says
she found a damp cigarette

00:05:18.116 --> 00:05:19.652
in her Taco Bell meal.

00:05:19.652 --> 00:05:20.919
That's disgusting.

00:05:20.919 --> 00:05:22.822
To be honest,
I'd rather find a...

00:05:22.822 --> 00:05:23.990
cicada.

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:26.558
They only pop up
once every 17 years,

00:05:26.558 --> 00:05:27.893
so it's easy to forget
about them.

00:05:27.893 --> 00:05:30.095
But it's okay, as long as
you don't forget about...

00:05:30.095 --> 00:05:31.129
Mother's Day.

00:05:31.129 --> 00:05:32.298
I mean, how could you?

00:05:32.298 --> 00:05:33.966
Flowers, cards, chocolates --

00:05:33.966 --> 00:05:35.601
Mother's Day stuff
is everywhere.

00:05:35.601 --> 00:05:37.303
No matter where you turn,
you can't escape it.

00:05:37.303 --> 00:05:38.370
It's kind of like...

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:40.373
the royal family.

00:05:40.373 --> 00:05:42.909
Every TV show and movie
is about them,

00:05:42.909 --> 00:05:44.944
and now they're taking over
YouTube, too.

00:05:44.944 --> 00:05:47.780
I can't wait to see their first
prank video, when they...

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:50.482
put a cigarette
in someone's taco.

00:05:50.482 --> 00:05:51.584
What a terrible meal.

00:05:51.584 --> 00:05:53.452
It is the opposite
of what you'll get on...

00:05:53.452 --> 00:05:54.787
Mother's Day,

00:05:54.787 --> 00:05:55.955
and you get to eat it in bed.

00:05:55.955 --> 00:05:57.389
So, in conclusion...

00:05:57.389 --> 00:05:59.024
this should be fun...

00:05:59.024 --> 00:06:00.625
there's gonna be a ton..

00:06:00.625 --> 00:06:02.494
Mom, you're number one...

00:06:02.494 --> 00:06:04.397
think outside the bun.

00:06:04.397 --> 00:06:06.632
[ Cheers and applause ]
This has been a "News Smash."

00:06:06.632 --> 00:06:11.637
