00:06:11.637 --> 00:06:15.241 line:0%
First up, the WNBA champions,
the Seattle Storm.

00:06:15.241 --> 00:06:17.042 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:17.042 --> 00:06:19.312
They visited President Biden
today, and get this --

00:06:19.312 --> 00:06:21.280
they're the first WNBA team

00:06:21.280 --> 00:06:24.316
to be invited to the White House
since 2015.

00:06:24.316 --> 00:06:27.053
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:27.053 --> 00:06:28.421
It's a pretty big deal.

00:06:28.421 --> 00:06:31.090
Speaking of storms
that are a pretty big deal...

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:32.491
tropical depression Henri.

00:06:32.491 --> 00:06:34.193
[ Laughter ]
Over the weekend,

00:06:34.193 --> 00:06:37.163
45 million people were
under a tropical storm warning,

00:06:37.163 --> 00:06:39.965
so, last week, things on the
East Coast were hot and sticky

00:06:39.965 --> 00:06:41.934
and, this week,
things were just wet.

00:06:41.934 --> 00:06:43.369
[ Laughter ]
And if you want something

00:06:43.369 --> 00:06:45.938
that's just hot, wet,
and sticky, why not try...

00:06:45.938 --> 00:06:48.074
Starbucks' pumpkin spice latte?

00:06:48.074 --> 00:06:50.509
[ Laughter and applause ]
It's back.

00:06:50.509 --> 00:06:52.745
Starting tomorrow.

00:06:52.745 --> 00:06:54.380
Some people are excited,
while others think

00:06:54.380 --> 00:06:56.349
it's too early
for pumpkin spice.

00:06:56.349 --> 00:06:58.383
Either way, drinking one
is way better than...

00:06:58.383 --> 00:07:01.920
eating a pizza covered
in nuts and bolts.

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:04.490
A woman reportedly ate half
of her Domino's pizza

00:07:04.490 --> 00:07:06.892
before finding them
in her toppings.

00:07:06.892 --> 00:07:09.128
Can you imagine digesting
all that cheese and metal?

00:07:09.128 --> 00:07:10.829
I mean, that would rock you
like a...

00:07:10.829 --> 00:07:12.632
hurricane that was...
[ Laughter ]

00:07:12.632 --> 00:07:14.900
...downgraded
to a tropical depression.

00:07:14.900 --> 00:07:16.602
Sure, it doesn't feel good
to be demoted,

00:07:16.602 --> 00:07:18.638
but keep your head up, Henri.

00:07:18.638 --> 00:07:20.940
If you work hard
and do your best,

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:22.541
you, too, can be the...

00:07:22.541 --> 00:07:24.777
Storm invited
to the White House.

00:07:24.777 --> 00:07:27.079
The team took pictures
with the Bidens,

00:07:27.079 --> 00:07:29.314
and, of course, a lot of the
players are taller than them.

00:07:29.314 --> 00:07:32.618
And, if you want something tall,
that's from Seattle, why not try

00:07:32.618 --> 00:07:34.854
Starbucks' pumpkin spice latte.

00:07:34.854 --> 00:07:38.758
It's only five bucks for a tall.

00:07:38.758 --> 00:07:41.593
So, it'll be on the house,
if you...

00:07:41.593 --> 00:07:43.596
find nuts and bolts in it.

00:07:43.596 --> 00:07:44.997
If that woman sues Domino's,

00:07:44.997 --> 00:07:46.432
she could probably
make a lot of money.

00:07:46.432 --> 00:07:47.599
I bet she could even...

00:07:47.599 --> 00:07:49.668
make it rain.

00:07:49.668 --> 00:07:51.637
Henri broke the record
for rainfall

00:07:51.637 --> 00:07:54.606
in one hour in New York,
which is nuts.

00:07:54.606 --> 00:07:56.342
And bolts.

00:07:56.342 --> 00:07:58.010
In conclusion...

00:07:58.010 --> 00:07:59.645
OMG...

00:07:59.645 --> 00:08:01.180
FYI...

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:02.447
PSL...

00:08:02.447 --> 00:08:03.782
FML.

00:08:03.782 --> 00:08:05.985
This has been a "News Smash."

