00:08:52.198 --> 00:08:54.500
followed by a new song
called "Dead Right Now."

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:56.868
And, if you want to be
dead right now, why not try

00:08:56.868 --> 00:09:00.672
Sam Adams' new beer
that's 28% alcohol?

00:09:00.672 --> 00:09:02.207
