a lot of people are on edge.

00:09:15.321 --> 00:09:16.555
Regardless of what happens,

00:09:16.555 --> 00:09:18.157
there's no doubt
the whole thing is...

00:09:18.157 --> 00:09:19.392
nuts.

00:09:19.392 --> 00:09:22.562
There's a lot of misinformation
out there,

00:09:22.562 --> 00:09:24.262
but experts say
the vaccine is safe.

00:09:24.262 --> 00:09:26.165
You know what's not safe?

00:09:26.165 --> 00:09:27.966
Sam Adams' new beer.

00:09:27.966 --> 00:09:29.768
One sip,
you'll be upside-down, naked,

00:09:29.768 --> 00:09:32.404
