00:09:41.147 --> 00:09:42.714
In conclusion...

00:09:42.714 --> 00:09:44.517
just relax...

00:09:44.517 --> 00:09:45.918
love the tracks...

00:09:45.918 --> 00:09:47.386
check the facts...

00:09:47.386 --> 00:09:50.289
