Netflix says it's on track
to be their biggest show ever.

00:10:01.033 --> 00:10:02.735
If you haven't seen it,
you should check it out,

00:10:02.735 --> 00:10:04.136
though it might be hard
to understand,

00:10:04.136 --> 00:10:05.704
if you don't have subtitles on.

00:10:05.704 --> 00:10:07.606
Speaking of things
that are hard to understand...

00:10:07.606 --> 00:10:08.773
the debt ceiling.

00:10:08.773 --> 00:10:10.209
[ Laughter ]
Are we raising it,

00:10:10.209 --> 00:10:11.777
are we lowering it?
What's going on?

00:10:11.777 --> 00:10:13.879
It's dominated
the news cycle all week

00:10:13.879 --> 00:10:15.247
and it's got everyone
stressed out.

00:10:15.247 --> 00:10:17.383
It almost makes you want
to just curl up in a ball and

00:10:17.383 --> 00:10:18.683
listen to Adele.

00:10:18.683 --> 00:10:19.952
[ Laughter and cheering ]

00:10:19.952 --> 00:10:22.888
Her first song in six years
comes out next week.

00:10:22.888 --> 00:10:24.223
She released a teaser
for the song,

00:10:24.223 --> 00:10:26.158
and everyone's
really excited for it.

00:10:26.158 --> 00:10:27.693
You know what no one's
excited for?

00:10:27.693 --> 00:10:29.461
Grey Poupon Wine.

00:10:29.461 --> 00:10:32.731
Yeah, it's made with grapes
and mustard seeds.

00:10:32.731 --> 00:10:34.099
I'm not sure
who this appeals to.

00:10:34.099 --> 00:10:35.701
I mean,
I don't want to drink it.

00:10:35.701 --> 00:10:37.803
To be honest, I'd rather just
sign up to play...

00:10:37.803 --> 00:10:39.104
"Squid Game."

00:10:39.104 --> 00:10:41.239
It's intense. Hundreds of people
fighting to the death

00:10:41.239 --> 00:10:42.574
to pay off their debts.
They're crying.

00:10:42.574 --> 00:10:44.242
They're screaming.
They're a total wreck.

00:10:44.242 --> 00:10:45.578
Kind of like everyone
when they...

00:10:45.578 --> 00:10:47.246
listen to Adele.

00:10:47.246 --> 00:10:49.748
The teaser for her song
is only 20 seconds long,

00:10:49.748 --> 00:10:51.883
but it has
over 8 million views.

00:10:51.883 --> 00:10:53.118
It's called "Easy on Me."

00:10:53.118 --> 00:10:55.487
And you know what hasn't
been easy on me?

00:10:55.487 --> 00:10:57.255
Understanding the debt ceiling.

00:10:57.255 --> 00:11:00.092
Congress has agreed
to raise it for two months

00:11:00.092 --> 00:11:01.760
by $480 billion,

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:04.429
which is also how much
you need to pay me to try...

00:11:04.429 --> 00:11:06.432
Grey Poupon Wine.

00:11:06.432 --> 00:11:09.468
No one wants to pay
for mustard that gets you drunk.

00:11:09.468 --> 00:11:11.370
You know what else
no one wants to pay for?

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:13.238
Raising the debt ceiling. Again.

00:11:13.238 --> 00:11:14.673
But, hey, Congress, if you're
still strapped for cash,

00:11:14.673 --> 00:11:15.674
there's always...

00:11:15.674 --> 00:11:16.842
"Squid Game."

00:11:16.842 --> 00:11:18.343
In conclusion...

00:11:18.343 --> 00:11:19.745
here we go...

00:11:19.745 --> 00:11:21.112
need more dough..

00:11:21.112 --> 00:11:22.547
awesome show...

00:11:22.547 --> 00:11:23.782
just no.

00:11:23.782 --> 00:11:25.884
This has been a "News Smash."

00:11:25.884 --> 00:11:29.889
♪♪

00:11:29.889 --> 00:11:31.657 line:0%
First up, the supply chain.

00:11:31.657 --> 00:11:33.459 line:0%
President Biden just met with
several companies

00:11:33.459 --> 00:11:36.562
like Walmart, Target, and FedEx
to discuss solutions,

00:11:36.562 --> 00:11:38.296
and it's not looking great.

00:11:38.296 --> 00:11:39.965
But you know
who is looking great?

00:11:39.965 --> 00:11:41.466
Paul Rudd.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:11:41.466 --> 00:11:44.703
He was named "People's"
Sexiest Man Alive. Good for him.

00:11:44.703 --> 00:11:47.206
He's universally beloved.
He makes us all laugh.

00:11:47.206 --> 00:11:49.341
But if you prefer someone
who's universally beloved

00:11:49.341 --> 00:11:52.344
and makes us all cry,
there's always...Adele.

00:11:52.344 --> 00:11:54.280
She just debuted a new song

00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:57.049
in an Amazon holiday commercial,
and it's fantastic.

00:11:57.049 --> 00:11:59.451
The song is called "Hold On,"
and it's all about

00:11:59.451 --> 00:12:00.753
not giving up.

00:12:00.753 --> 00:12:02.855
But if you want to give up,
why not try...

00:12:02.855 --> 00:12:06.925
Arby's new French Fry Vodka/

00:12:06.925 --> 00:12:08.693
They're releasing two bottles,
and apparently,

00:12:08.693 --> 00:12:10.730
they have the same
"flavor profile"

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:13.065
as their curly
and crinkle-cut fries.

00:12:13.065 --> 00:12:14.432
[ Laughter ]

00:12:14.432 --> 00:12:16.501
I don't understand
how that would even work.

00:12:16.501 --> 00:12:19.238
Speaking of things I don't
understand...the supply chain.

00:12:19.238 --> 00:12:22.207
[ Laughter ]
Shipping, trucking, inflation.

00:12:22.207 --> 00:12:23.842
All of it has people
really stressed out.

00:12:23.842 --> 00:12:25.310
But it's going to be okay.

00:12:25.310 --> 00:12:28.146
Just take a deep breath,
pour yourself some wine...

00:12:28.146 --> 00:12:29.448
and listen to Adele.

00:12:29.448 --> 00:12:31.383
The new album drops next week.

00:12:31.383 --> 00:12:33.685
Her first album was "19."
We loved that.

00:12:33.685 --> 00:12:36.855
[ Cheers and applause ]
Then "21." Loved that.

00:12:36.855 --> 00:12:39.858
[ Cheers and applause ]
Then "25." And now "30."

00:12:39.858 --> 00:12:43.562
We're really -- we've really
seen her grow up over the years.

00:12:43.562 --> 00:12:44.896
You know who hasn't grown up?

00:12:44.896 --> 00:12:47.199
Paul Rudd.
I mean, look at the guy.

00:12:47.199 --> 00:12:49.969
He -- He only gets better
with age.

00:12:49.969 --> 00:12:51.837
You know what doesn't
get better with age?

00:12:51.837 --> 00:12:53.671
Arby's Vodka.

00:12:53.671 --> 00:12:55.641
I -- I just don't get it.

00:12:55.641 --> 00:12:57.976
I mean, from the vodka itself
to the label,

00:12:57.976 --> 00:12:59.078
all the way to the...

00:12:59.078 --> 00:13:00.312
bottleneck.

00:13:00.312 --> 00:13:01.847
Everything's
completely backed up.

00:13:01.847 --> 00:13:03.115
So it'll affect prices.

00:13:03.115 --> 00:13:05.817
And if you order anything
online, be prepared to...

00:13:05.817 --> 00:13:07.119
hold on.

00:13:07.119 --> 00:13:08.654
In conclusion...

00:13:08.654 --> 00:13:09.788
what a guy...

00:13:09.788 --> 00:13:11.356
time to cry...

00:13:11.356 --> 00:13:12.858
low supply...

00:13:12.858 --> 00:13:15.227
just why?
This has been a "News Smash."

